WEBVTT

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:17.400
I pick these!

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.320
Didn't I say "one"?

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.950
Chase two hares, and you'll catch neither!

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.850
Did you bring something, too, Cocona?

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:26.880
Yes.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.020
My pet, Uex—

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.880
He'll die.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.340
I said to bring some<i>thing</i> precious to you.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.630
I recommend an inanimate object.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:34.630
Life

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.260
I don't have anything else I treasure.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.010
You can have this, then.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.680
I don't want it.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.520
But it's all straight and smooth!

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:46.820
A baton, huh?

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.270
It seems to be the right length, too.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:50.400
You heard him!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:58.550
Your impedances have started to 
stabilize, but that's not enough!

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.670
Our opponents' are as stable as a rock.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:01.620
They were built differently, 
including their brains.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.230
<i>They were built differently, 
including their brains.</i>

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.290
Built?

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.620
<i>Be careful. They're sure to show up again.</i>

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.300
We've lost three fragments to them now.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.640
<i>Looks like they can open a hole in 
whichever Pure Illusion they choose.</i>

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:17.500
No fair!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.680
How are we supposed to contend with that?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.760
That's why we have the plugi—

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:22.900
Transformation items!

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.180
Hold up the prized possessions 
you picked, and say...

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:27.400
Flip Flapping!

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:31.190
Flip Flap...ung.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.190
<i>"-ping."</i>

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.320
<i>Those are the magic words.</i>

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:38.780
Cocona.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.160
We'll beat them this time!

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.160
<i>Impedance:</i>

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.710
<i>0.03...</i>

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.300
Yeah...

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.250
<i>0.02...</i>

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:54.690
Huh?

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:55.790
Papika?

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.560
So cold!

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.110
Sheesh.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:13.360
Who's there?

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.630
Greetings.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:57.670
Yayaka?

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.080
Why are you dressed like that?

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:02.840
Yayaka!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.110
Huh?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.780
Wait, what?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.280
Is this our school?

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.980
Yayaka!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.560
Stop that!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.160
Someone's here.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.720
Who?

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.530
Where'd Bu-chan go?

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.960
Bu-chan!

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:44.540
Bu-chan!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:49.600
Science Lab

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.920
Where'd he go?

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:51.130
Papika?

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:54.600
Who's there?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:57.980
Just my imagination?

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.090
Boo.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.730
Found you, Cocona.

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:09.550
Seriously, don't do that! 
I'll have a heart attack!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.600
Heart attack?

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.880
There's something strange about this place!

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:16.840
That way.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.040
W-Wait!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.130
Home Ec. Room

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.980
Hollo!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.460
H-Hello.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.730
qrE3TInqs.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.860
Transform!

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:45.420
Transform! Transform!

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.420
Magic words!

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.240
Papika!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.520
Papika...

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.490
qrE3TInqs.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.060
Why? Why?!

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.440
Flip Fla...

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:06.940
Fla...

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:07.930
..pping!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.800
Flip Fla...

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.170
What is this?

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:18.810
Cocona!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.810
You're kidding, right?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.160
Flip Fla...

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.080
...pping! I keep telling you!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:40.900
Cocona...

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.480
Papika?

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.060
What is... this?

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.130
Papika!

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.750
Papika, wake up!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:13.070
So warm!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.580
qrE3TInqs.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.710
What does "greetings" mean?

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:31.100
Wow...

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.010
Greetings!

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.180
Thank you.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.400
Uh, where are our uniforms?

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.430
Bu-chan, you look so cute!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.040
Fun

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:11.470
Was that building always there?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:15.570
Let's go.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:17.150
Y-Yeah.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.880
Such a nice aroma.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.460
So sweet!

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:49.740
Ow!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.340
You okay, Cocona?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:53.220
Yeah.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.260
I-I'm fine.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.600
Oh?

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.850
That was fun!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.560
Yeah. Everyone here is so nice.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:12.900
Let's sleep.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.190
Yeah.

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:34.820
What should we do today?

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:36.320
"What," you ask?

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.860
Look for the fragment, remember?

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.240
Oh, right!

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.970
What's wrong?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:51.110
qrE3TInqs.

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:05.510
Delicious.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.500
So sweet!

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:08.790
Ow!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.480
I-I'm fine, okay?

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:25.220
qrE3TInqs.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.340
Greetings!

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:35.480
So sweet!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.610
Joo ogay?

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:39.780
Yeah.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.460
It's all right.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.080
Yeah.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:58.280
What should we do tomorrow?

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.790
Embroidery, I guess?

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:01.840
Oh, okay.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.270
The rain just won't let up, huh?

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.100
I like the rain.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.420
I kinda like it, too.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.040
Night.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.740
Goodnight.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:25.740
Ya—

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.210
Keep it down.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.220
So sweet!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:37.610
Are you alone?

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.060
Where are the other two?

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.360
What, trying to probe us?

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:43.610
I'm just worried.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.410
You're as soft as ever.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.640
Don't you realize the situation we're in here?

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:01.290
This world is looping.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:02.700
Ow!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.620
Stupid. What're you getting 
all hot and bothered for?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.160
I'm not—

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.110
It's Pure Illusion's doing.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:13.760
Once you enter a Pure Illusion world, 
you're influenced by its nature.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.460
It's happened before, right?

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.640
So this world gets you hot and bothered?

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:21.090
And it loops? Really?

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:23.310
And you're unaffected?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.090
My mindset is totally unlike yours.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.660
Why are flakes like you two doing this?

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.200
Why are you collecting them, Cocona?

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.980
I mean the amorphous.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:40.610
She says she can't come here without me.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.390
Why should that matter to you?

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:45.990
And it's somewhat fun at times...

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.350
Fun?

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:50.720
What's so funny?

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:52.610
Play along.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:56.630
Pure Illusion ain't a place you 
can come to for fun and games.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.830
Go back before the bell finishes ringing.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.680
Yayaka!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:13.680
You're afraid of failure, aren't you?

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:16.710
Yeah.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:25.460
Our uniforms...

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.720
Papika! Papika!

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:33.560
Morning.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.370
Let's look for the fragment 
and get out of here.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.500
But it's raining outside.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:38.880
Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:41.300
Yayaka said this world is looping!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.830
Yayaka?!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.020
Looping?

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.880
qrE3TInqs.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.220
Greetings!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.030
So sweet!

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:57.590
Don't get swept up.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.440
Papika! Papika!

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.860
Cocona!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:05.860
Come on!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.700
We have to look for the fragment, remember?

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:11.130
That's right!

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:15.230
qrE3TInqs.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.620
Should we really have left him there?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.400
Well, he wasn't getting fixed.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:25.670
Three...

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.770
Four...

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.300
Five...

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.400
Shh! We can't let them find us!

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.360
It's not working.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.580
Eleven...

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.440
Huh?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.560
It's a dead end.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.350
Do you want to check a different floor?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.620
Wait.

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.690
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:46.980
Sniff...

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.700
A breeze!

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:50.660
What is it?

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.200
A room?

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:56.080
It couldn't be a twelfth room, could it?

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.760
What's that sound?

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.480
The bell for midnight.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.960
Yayaka said to get back before 
the bell finished ringing!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:11.340
What's the matter?

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:26.400
Really?

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:29.940
Yeah. The bell only rang eleven times.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.660
So that's our time limit, huh?

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:35.240
Once the bell for midnight rings 
eleven times, the night ends.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.170
Where was it?

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:38.320
Around here.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.410
Papika, hurry up!

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:46.660
Found it!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.350
That's...

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.220
We should hurry!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.960
What now?

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:03.440
The clock tower!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.870
Those girls were hiding the clock tower!

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:06.940
So it's probably...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.080
...suspicious!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.680
Good day.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:16.890
Good evening.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.530
Yayaka!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.040
You two.

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:25.130
Yayaka.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:25.960
No time.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.460
Don't follow us!

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.960
Which means we should!

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:46.840
Hah! We caught up!

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:49.610
You're so naïve. This is where it gets real.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.240
Hold it!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.720
Hey! Let go!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.320
I won't!

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:04.150
I said... let go!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.460
Flip...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.300
Flapping!

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.240
Just try and keep up!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.110
Papika!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.030
Flip Flapping...

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.670
Bell is in sight.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.160
Incoming.

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:57.470
Hard.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.130
Yayaka!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:00.050
No time to play around!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.060
I know!

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:09.440
Papika!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.980
I'm okay.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.240
Yayaka!

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.510
What is this?

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.830
Why? Aren't you on the same side?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.490
That's why I keep saying you're a softie.

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.800
Didn't I tell you? My mindset 
is nothing like yours.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.470
Crap! The time!

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:48.480
Cocona!

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:55.150
Papika!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.340
You...

00:18:59.200 --> 00:18:59.940
Incoming.

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:00.860
Here.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:05.580
Can't touch me!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:08.880
Huh?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.140
Why? Why?!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.890
Did you run out of gas?

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:16.000
Cocona!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.050
Go!

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:21.920
Huh?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:30.940
Flip Flapping!

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:49.570
It's gonna rewind!

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.580
Cocona!

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:09.470
Oh.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:10.840
The twelfth time.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.460
Hooray!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:30.500
What?!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:34.540
Time moved forward because you removed 
the amorphous's defense trap!

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.300
Twins!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.130
Yeah.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.020
Papika!

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:40.840
Open, open, open!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.630
It's not working!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:43.840
What do we do?!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:45.130
Hey.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:54.780
Greetings.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.160
School!

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:06.360
Our usual school, yeah.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.400
You helped us out?

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.370
I just didn't wanna owe you anything.

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:13.620
Thank you—

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.200
Hand over the amorphous.

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:17.200
No way!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:20.850
It's not the type of thing you think it is.

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.040
No.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:31.850
Papika and I found this together.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:35.890
Are you prepared for what that entails?

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.360
Not at all!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:41.530
But if you're trying to do something 
dangerous, I'll stop you!

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:43.080
We'll never lose!

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:47.500
Let's go.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.120
Yayaka!

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:34.350
N-Next time... on <i>Flip Flappers</i>:

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:35.800
qrE3TInqs.

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:36.770
N-Next time, Pure—

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:39.980
qrE3TInqs...

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:39.980
Eek! Help!

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:40.640
Pure Play
